		{"id":"b168ea78430aa426","type":"text","text":"Created [[Joseph Rosenbaum]] and [[My Style Guide]] with the help of the Professor","x":-560,"y":72,"width":250,"height":125,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"8fa74d9b77c27bc5","type":"text","text":"Ran [[Why AI might (not) Save the World.]] through the Professor (with the notes on myself and style guide as context), and asked to recommend a series of blogs based on it","x":-560,"y":297,"width":250,"height":202,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d1afee556bc25ad3","type":"text","text":"Used #skeletonofthought to outline each one, and then write the blog itself separated into a main section, a reflection section, and a meditations section","x":-560,"y":577,"width":250,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a02df2e159f9af85","type":"text","text":"Review and edit","x":-560,"y":877,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0dac291fa7d745b2","type":"text","text":"# Phase 1: \n## The Blogs","x":-560,"y":-343,"width":250,"height":89,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"02ffd8d0bb0d5573","type":"text","text":"Used previously written diatribe [[Why AI might (not) Save the World.]] on [[Marc Andreessen]]'s blog https://a16z.com/ai-will-save-the-world/","x":-560,"y":-202,"width":250,"height":179,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"2d93feb02d5c179f","type":"text","text":"# Phase 2:\n## Audio","x":-160,"y":-358,"width":250,"height":122,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"6a1554a59179128f","type":"text","text":"Record myself reading each blog in #descript.","x":-160,"y":-152,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3d3c442e1e4b1c53","type":"text","text":"Edit and enhance audio","x":-160,"y":-18,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1e8ef50b50c0a416","type":"text","text":"# Phase 3: \n## Create Video","x":310,"y":-352,"width":250,"height":97,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a5d90399d22bc1ff","type":"text","text":"Paste Blog into [[🎨Kaiber (Tool)]]","x":310,"y":-176,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cd574a61371d3f26","type":"text","text":"Generate and edit outputs.","x":310,"y":-32,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b94a312cbe3609b7","type":"text","text":"Go to [Kaiber](www.kaiber.ai) and Create Video","x":310,"y":96,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d0562aee8e99611b","type":"text","text":"Create a Flipbook, and upload the audio file","x":310,"y":228,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1acb51b59971fe38","type":"text","text":"Input the image prompts from [[🎨Kaiber (Tool)]] into the **description** and **in the style of** ","x":308,"y":354,"width":250,"height":114,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3fe8bb9c56e5b15b","type":"text","text":"Fill out options, like aspect ratio, and any other knobs you want to experiment with","x":310,"y":538,"width":250,"height":130,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ffe20706c3c09117","type":"text","text":"Create Video when ready...and WAIT a very long time for it to render","x":310,"y":759,"width":250,"height":109,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"23947d3c711c94d0","type":"text","text":"Game Over - Restart from last checkpoint","x":470,"y":1009,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"187f1485aff94723","type":"text","text":"Upscale and WAIT another very long time for it to upscale","x":90,"y":1009,"width":250,"height":119,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d9520941953e71a4","x":78,"y":1251,"width":250,"height":97,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"Download video (also takes a while)"},
		{"id":"bd2527c00b752653","x":880,"y":118,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Ask AI to pick out a few clips"},
		{"id":"fc20e7394f811b5b","x":880,"y":243,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Duplicate to new composition"},
		{"id":"9ec3d8a7a907737b","x":880,"y":403,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Add captions"},
		{"id":"6526a22487ff7af2","x":880,"y":565,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Export videos"},
		{"id":"f5011b969a8a2f9e","type":"text","text":"Upload into descript (along with assets)","x":880,"y":-176,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"638fc7d93254e70b","x":880,"y":-39,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Add intro and outro"},
